# Bootstrap CSS Helper Classes

Bootstrap CSS Helper Classes — tayyor Bootstrap classlar bo‘lib,
CSS yozmasdan elementning rangini, backgroundini, joylashishini,
ko‘rinishini va responsive holatini boshqarishga yordam beradi.


==================================================
1. TEXT HELPER CLASSES
==================================================

Matn rangini o‘zgartirish uchun ishlatiladi.

.text-muted
→ Xira/kulrang matn

.text-primary
→ Primary rangdagi matn

.text-success
→ Muvaffaqiyat/success matn

.text-info
→ Information matn

.text-warning
→ Ogohlantirish matni

.text-danger
→ Xato yoki danger matn


Misol:

<p class="text-muted">Xira matn</p>
<p class="text-primary">Primary matn</p>
<p class="text-success">Success matn</p>
<p class="text-info">Info matn</p>
<p class="text-warning">Warning matn</p>
<p class="text-danger">Danger matn</p>


==================================================
2. BACKGROUND HELPER CLASSES
==================================================

Elementning orqa fon rangini o‘zgartirish uchun ishlatiladi.

.bg-primary
→ Primary background

.bg-success
→ Success background

.bg-info
→ Info background

.bg-warning
→ Warning background

.bg-danger
→ Danger background


Misol:

<p class="bg-primary">Primary background</p>
<p class="bg-success">Success background</p>
<p class="bg-info">Info background</p>
<p class="bg-warning">Warning background</p>
<p class="bg-danger">Danger background</p>


TEXT va BACKGROUND farqi:

.text-danger
→ MATN rangi o‘zgaradi

.bg-danger
→ ORQA FON rangi o‘zgaradi


==================================================
3. .pull-left
==================================================

Elementni chap tomonga suradi.

<div class="pull-left">
    Chap
</div>

.pull-left → chapga


==================================================
4. .pull-right
==================================================

Elementni o‘ng tomonga suradi.

<div class="pull-right">
    O‘ng
</div>

.pull-right → o‘ngga


==================================================
5. .center-block
==================================================

Elementni markazlashtirishga yordam beradi.

<div class="center-block">
    Markaz
</div>

.center-block
→ display: block
→ margin-left: auto
→ margin-right: auto


==================================================
6. .clearfix
==================================================

Float ishlatilganda float holatini tozalash uchun ishlatiladi.

<div class="clearfix"></div>

.pull-left yoki .pull-right ishlatilgandan keyin
clearfix float muammosini tozalashga yordam beradi.

.pull-left / .pull-right
        ↓
      float
        ↓
.clearfix
        ↓
    float clear


==================================================
7. .show
==================================================

Elementni ko‘rsatadi.

<div class="show">
    Bu ko‘rinadi
</div>

.show
→ display: block


==================================================
8. .hidden
==================================================

Elementni butunlay yashiradi.

<p class="hidden">
    Bu ko‘rinmaydi
</p>

.hidden
→ display: none

Element:
→ ko‘rinmaydi
→ joy ham egallamaydi


==================================================
9. .invisible
==================================================

Elementni ko‘rinmas qiladi,
lekin uning sahifadagi joyi saqlanadi.

<p class="invisible">
    Bu ko‘rinmaydi
</p>

.invisible
→ visibility: hidden

Farqi:

.hidden
→ ko‘rinmaydi
→ joy egallamaydi

.invisible
→ ko‘rinmaydi
→ joyi saqlanadi


==================================================
10. .sr-only
==================================================

Elementni oddiy foydalanuvchiga ko‘rsatmaydi,
lekin screen reader uchun mavjud qiladi.

<span class="sr-only">
    Bu screen reader uchun
</span>

.sr-only
→ accessibility uchun ishlatiladi


==================================================
11. .sr-only-focusable
==================================================

.sr-only bilan yashirilgan element
focus olganda yana ko‘rinadi.

Masalan, keyboard orqali TAB bosilganda.

<a class="sr-only sr-only-focusable" href="#">
    Skip to content
</a>

.sr-only
→ yashiradi

.sr-only-focusable
→ focus bo‘lganda ko‘rsatadi


==================================================
12. .text-hide
==================================================

Elementdagi matnni yashirib,
background image ishlatishga yordam beradi.

<div class="text-hide">
    Logo
</div>

.text-hide
→ textni yashirish uchun ishlatiladi.


==================================================
13. .close
==================================================

Yopish belgisi uchun ishlatiladi.

<button class="close">
    &times;
</button>

Natija:

×


==================================================
14. .caret
==================================================

Dropdown uchun kichik uchburchak belgisini chiqaradi.

<button>
    Menu <span class="caret"></span>
</button>

Natija taxminan:

Menu ▼


==================================================
15. RESPONSIVE UTILITIES
==================================================

Responsive — ekran o‘lchamiga qarab
elementni ko‘rsatish yoki yashirish.

Bootstrap 3 ekran o‘lchamlari:

xs → Extra Small → Telefon → < 768px

sm → Small → Tablet → ≥ 768px

md → Medium → Desktop → ≥ 992px

lg → Large → Katta Desktop → ≥ 1200px


==================================================
