==================================================
20. VISIBLE CLASSES
==================================================

visible classlar elementni
ma'lum ekran o‘lchamida ko‘rsatish uchun ishlatiladi.

.visible-xs-block
→ faqat XS ekranda block sifatida ko‘rsatadi

.visible-sm-block
→ faqat SM ekranda block sifatida ko‘rsatadi

.visible-md-block
→ faqat MD ekranda block sifatida ko‘rsatadi

.visible-lg-block
→ faqat LG ekranda block sifatida ko‘rsatadi


Misol:

<h1 class="visible-xs-block">
    Faqat telefon uchun
</h1>


==================================================
21. VISIBLE DISPLAY TYPES
==================================================

Bootstrap 3.2+ da visible classlarning
3 xil display turi bor:

.visible-*-block
→ display: block

.visible-*-inline
→ display: inline

.visible-*-inline-block
→ display: inline-block


Masalan, SM uchun:

.visible-sm-block
.visible-sm-inline
.visible-sm-inline-block


Misol:

<p class="visible-sm-block">
    Tablet uchun
</p>


==================================================
22. OLD VISIBLE CLASSES
==================================================

Quyidagi classlar Bootstrap 3.2 dan boshlab
deprecated hisoblanadi:

.visible-xs
.visible-sm
.visible-md
.visible-lg

Yangi usuldan foydalanish yaxshi:

.visible-xs-block
.visible-sm-block
.visible-md-block
.visible-lg-block


