==================================================
ASOSIY XULOSA
==================================================

Bootstrap CSS Helper Classes —
tayyor CSS classlar.

Ular yordamida:

1. Matn rangini o‘zgartiramiz
2. Background rangini o‘zgartiramiz
3. Elementni chap/o‘ngga joylaymiz
4. Elementni markazlashtiramiz
5. Elementni yashiramiz
6. Elementni ko‘rsatamiz
7. Ekran o‘lchamiga qarab elementni boshqaramiz
8. Accessibility uchun screen reader classlardan foydalanamiz

Asosiy mantiq:

.text-*   → text
.bg-*     → background
.hidden-* → yashirish
.visible-* → ko‘rsatish
xs/sm/md/lg → screen size
